    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3428930/extras/a16f55d7d648c37aead96441ca87c450.avif?t=1754476854\" width=800 height=110 /></span><i>Complete quests to unlock powerful heroes, each with a distinct playstyle and a loyal pet that fights alongside you.</i></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3428930/extras/35acb23906e63195f2abf61494dc4d78.poster.avif?t=1754476854\" width=600 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3428930/extras/35acb23906e63195f2abf61494dc4d78.webm?t=1754476854\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3428930/extras/35acb23906e63195f2abf61494dc4d78.mp4?t=1754476854\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3428930/extras/822489332aa2ffb2f2caf3121e2ac2f0.avif?t=1754476854\" width=800 height=110 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Heavy Weapons:</strong> Slam shockwaves to obliterate foes.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Bow:</strong> Snipe enemies from a distance or unleash deadly volleys.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dual Swords:</strong> Rapid slashes for aggressive combat.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Sword &amp; Shield:</strong> Balanced offense and defense.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Utility Staff:</strong> AoE damage, enemy control, and buffs.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Summoning Staff:</strong> Call forth creatures to fight for you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3428930/extras/91ae31cf5c0f1da94dead19f2e2a7bd3.poster.avif?t=1754476854\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3428930/extras/91ae31cf5c0f1da94dead19f2e2a7bd3.webm?t=1754476854\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3428930/extras/91ae31cf5c0f1da94dead19f2e2a7bd3.mp4?t=1754476854\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3428930/extras/32667b1bbd087a9dd10a6f266bdd4776.avif?t=1754476854\" width=800 height=110 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Cycle through weapons, spells, and gear, adapting to each wave\u2019s challenges.</i></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Projectiles Spells:</strong> Direct, high-impact attacks.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Area Spells:</strong> Devastating bursts or sustained damage.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Utility Spells:</strong> Enhance abilities, heal, or manipulate enemies.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3428930/extras/0cca1158427b0c3b6161914da98451dd.poster.avif?t=1754476854\" width=600 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3428930/extras/0cca1158427b0c3b6161914da98451dd.webm?t=1754476854\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3428930/extras/0cca1158427b0c3b6161914da98451dd.mp4?t=1754476854\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3428930/extras/9a1bfdcf4696bb8f8cd1b21f4aba0ac6.avif?t=1754476854\" width=800 height=110 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Run:</strong> Sprint for speed, damage reduction, and health regen\u2014but disable weapons.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dash:</strong> Instantly dodge attacks.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Defend:</strong> Block incoming damage with a shield.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3428930/extras/2bb4ca1dc5c786de914fbf22a0f961de.avif?t=1754476854\" width=800 height=110 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Wave Challenges:</strong> Earn powerful rewards by completing objectives.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Pirate Slime:</strong> Snatches your gold\u2014hunt it down next wave!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Power-ups:</strong> drop randomly from enemies.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Shop:</strong> Upgrade, sell, and refine your loadout.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3428930/extras/7d4ac20952a1da0ddd65e604e2fee263.poster.avif?t=1754476854\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3428930/extras/7d4ac20952a1da0ddd65e604e2fee263.webm?t=1754476854\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3428930/extras/7d4ac20952a1da0ddd65e604e2fee263.mp4?t=1754476854\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Why You\u2019ll Love Slime Attack: Survivor</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2714 <strong>Strategic Loadouts:</strong> Mix and match weapons, spells, and gear.<br>\u2714 <strong>High Replayability:</strong> Every run brings a fresh experience. <br>\u2714 <strong>Challenging Boss Fights:</strong> Face off against the mighty Yonians.<br>\u2714 <strong>Visual Customization:</strong> Your gear reflects on your character.<br>\u2714 <strong>Endless Action:</strong> Survive escalating waves and conquer unique biomes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfae <strong>Are you ready for the slime onslaught?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3428930/extras/fa142e423ad11360ab6500dcd58c378a.avif?t=1754476854\" width=800 height=110 /></span></p>",
